623335", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=asRyTVbUNakQ7kNvwFlO1DV&_nc_oc=AdoZD4D_Zt-RhhybFI_jWcqhOPMn5OYegRlHhci6NdSyR7W5143AGsEIP88E1TE7o4I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHik4KABOR7X0pAvnoEzGaVw4gohUiL5ACirDFPeChhRQ&oe=6A8C4662"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2q8qi7edOKUQ7kNvwG3Z-iA&_nc_oc=Adrp2bS17i-t6n_9oqM2MbAIn49Dh-KG2yBBWPHALxZqOh5kv-kP1zA_VYX4p8GJI1E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFc2CXw1Gv55C94FadBJRc6yOFGoH9HkZ5NXWZ1dcDgRw&oe=6A8C1BB3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yr7EyrYFo8kQ7kNvwF-Jyue&_nc_oc=Adq6AzaaMiXw1J05zlnckYO5UaJtwCdeGOuQr6SKB1XWF49wDsov2mt9hGnmM-SqCZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFOGkVpBdKIAYEDT6QxWQJ1p9DK9y-FAKHBmFUgJcZ6ww&oe=6A8C486B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M9eBg0noMjAQ7kNvwEmnxwY&_nc_oc=AdqQmrZAzcEgufrUL366lOdZ3_y0WVldcP8nfMmUeGMx8tnV2f-_LjBcDTTHcFdQJpk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEHFDmjNjqfZMcAg_ET3sbzctIs2v2h_kfVl2FDgwolSQ&oe=6A8C2D62"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qRsNSOxRsPwQ7kNvwFw9ANp&_nc_oc=AdrveMPSq0p640XHBAKyKx-KV9x9lD8JYrU0_fzAbJa43oHWHbRZUeugxfB9dfRaxvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH4_fJCQF1zF-g0p9AtzwEyKui7LxlISHM3J2ZppUEBOw&oe=6A8C2FFD"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292